  "description": "\"The girl my girlfriend had a secret crush on came in as my new roommate!\"\n\nDue to problems at work, Sehyun and Sunwoo became a long-distance couple. To fill the void left by Sunwoo and ease the financial burden, Sehyun decides to look for a roommate and finds Jina. While Jina was looking around Sehyun's house, she stops in front of a portrait of Sehyun drawn by Sunwoo. \n\nWithout thinking, she remembers Sunwoo, a schoolmate who drew her during high school, and Jina shows Sehyun an old portrait of herself. Suddenly, Sehyun remembers Sunwoo when he saw Jina's drawing. \n\n'I only draw for people I like.' \n\nWhat will be the relationship between Jina and Sunwoo? Will Sunwoo and Sehyun's love survive the wave called Jina?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4291002691)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc32408), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/your_portrait)",
